<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 448-6 AT LUNCH ON 4TH DAY VS NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 448-6 AT LUNCH ON 4TH DAY VS NZ.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 448 for six wickets in reply to New Zealand's first innings of 390 at lunch on the fourth day of the first test on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 390 (B.Pocock 70, S.Fleming 129, C.Cairns 67, D.Gough four for 91)</p>
<p>England first innings 448 for six wickets (overnight 366 for six) (A.Stewart 173, M.Atherton 83, G.Thorpe 117 not out, D.Cork 38 not out).</p>
